  "description": "Despite cooking up mouth-watering entrées as a master chef, Kijun is still a vampire that thirsts for human blood. Lucky for him, the young girl who was his “first bite” has stumbled into his restaurant, and into his trap! Finally after 25 years Miro will be his to enjoy once again, but… her blood tastes terrible! What has she been eating?! Time for Chef Hong to put his culinary skills to good use: to lavish her with delicacies and prepare a most succulent meal for himself!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
